      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}s&=\\frac{d}{t}\\\\75&=\\frac{380}{t}\\\\75t&=380\\\\t&=\\frac{380}{75}\\text{ h}=\\frac{76}{15}\\text{ h}\\\\t&=\\frac{76}{15}\\times60\\text{ min}=304\\text{ min}\\\\t&=5\\text{ h }4\\text{ min}\\end{align*}$$",
